<title>USA: Weichert Realtors posts 1996 volume of $11.8 bln.</title>
<headline>Weichert Realtors posts 1996 volume of $11.8 bln.</headline>
<dateline>MORRIS PLAINS, N.J. 1997-02-13</dateline>
<text>
<p>Weichert Realtors said on Thursday it posted a total sales volume of $11.8 billion in 1996, representing 60,500 transaction units.</p>
<p>Weichert said it invested $2 million in new computer technology in 1996.</p>
<p>((-- New York Newsdesk 212 859-1610))</p>
</text>
